  "html": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(65, 168, 95); font-size: 24px;\">If the first outcome is unavailable or patient is reluctant, move to the next option</span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;\">If the patient has been reviewed previously BY ANY CLINICIAN AT OUR SURGERY, for this current symptom or any related symptoms, please book a GP appointment. This does not include symptoms from LTCs</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></p><p></p><p><br></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\"><li style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">For telephone appointments, ensure the patient sends <strong>clear</strong> pictures of the rash (excluding intimate areas) before you book the appointment</span></li></ul><p><br></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\"><li style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\" id=\"isPasted\">For F2F appointments, advise patient to isolate as much as possible when coming to the surgery. This is so that they don&#39;t spread the rash if it&#39;s infectious. The patient should arrive just before their appointment to minimise time in the waiting room. If they&#39;re early, they should wait outside the surgery until the clinician calls them in. <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Add as a booking note to EMIS &amp; i</span>nform the reception team on site so that they can remind the patient on the day.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br></p>",
  "src": "rash",
  "sug": "Rash &nbsp;s uggested outcome: 1. Pharmacist same-day, F2F or telephone with clear pictures 2. Advise patient to go to an Urgent Care Centre",
  "title": "Outcome: Pharmacist"
 },
