or: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patient does not have regular medication for their blood pressure</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Zingtree outcome suggests:</li></ul><ol><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GP same-day, F2F</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Duty doctor list</li></ol><ul><li data-list-indent=\"1\" data-list-type=\"bulleted\" style=\"margin-left: 32px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p>No GP same day appt, therefore added to DD list</p></li></ul></div></div></div></details></div><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
