  "sug": "Women&#39;s Health &nbsp;suggested outcome: 1. Advise the patient to go to A&amp;E or call 999",
  "title": "Outcome: Emergency"
 },
 "wh_gp": {
  "code": "1.GPrtF2F",
  "html": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">\u26a0\ufe0f For any issues with sexual organs in pts under 16, book GP within a week F2F</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(65, 168, 95); font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u2757</span><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\"><strong>Do not book with Dr Lucy Chapman any patients 0-12 months</strong></span></span></span></p><p id=\"isPasted\"></p><p></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;\">If you suspect a safeguarding concern, book GP same-day F2F. If no capacity, speak with Duty Doctor on site.</span></p><div class=\"zt-accordion\"><details class=\"zt-ac-block\"><summary class=\"zt-ac-title\"><h3><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Duty Doctor template</span></strong></h3></summary><div class=\"zt-ac-body-container\"><div class=\"zt-ac-body\"><div id=\"isPasted\"><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Request</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;- one line stating what is requested of the Duty Doctor</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Symptom</strong> - issue / problem patient called for</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Zingtree information</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Current symptoms</u> - anything that was \"ticked\" on Zingtree, list these in bullet point</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Duration</u> - state how long patient has been experiencing symptoms (if relevant)</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Treatment trialled</u> - state any OTC or previous treatments the patient has tried (if relevant - from patient or recent EMIS consultation notes)</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Timeframe</u> of suggested outcome listed on ZT if DD not first option - same day, within 24 hours etc</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Clinicians</u> listed on ZT if DD not first option - state why these were not chosen</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>Example</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Management of high blood pressure with no symptoms</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patient blood pressure recorded at home 200/100</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patient does not have regular medication for their blood pressure</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Zingtree outcome suggests:</li></ul><ol><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GP same-day, F2F</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Duty doctor list</li></ol><ul><li data-list-indent=\"1\" data-list-type=\"bulleted\" style=\"margin-left: 32px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p>No GP same day appt, therefore added to DD list</p></li></ul></div></div></div></details></div><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
