 "wh_gp_3": {
  "code": "1.GPrtF2F",
  "html": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 50, 78); font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;\">\ud83d\udcde <strong>CH Information</strong></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{&quot;indent&quot;:2,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;numbered&quot;}]\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 50, 78);\">Continuity of care is really important in this case, as you are helping a couple with fertility issues.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 50, 78);\">Therefore, ideally, both partners should attend together, each having a distinct appointment <span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 50, 78);\" id=\"isPasted\">with the <strong>same</strong> GP. Ideally the appointments should be booked one after the other so appointments can be linked. </span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{&quot;indent&quot;:2,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;numbered&quot;}]\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 50, 78);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 50, 78);\">However, if this is not possible, each partner can attend at a convenient time for each.</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{&quot;indent&quot;:2,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;numbered&quot;}]\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><br></p><hr><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(65, 168, 95); font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(61, 142, 185);\"><strong>\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2695\ufe0f Clinician Notes</strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(65, 168, 95); font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(61, 142, 185);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">##iframe_contents: https://penroseportal.co.uk/pages/all-clinician-restrictions width=100% height=800px ##</span></strong></span></span></span></p><hr><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(65, 168, 95); font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffc </span><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Actions to note</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">When booking the x2 single appointment for this situation:</span></p><ol style=\"margin-left: 40px ;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(184, 49, 47); font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">ensure that both partners are registered at the same practice</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(184, 49, 47); font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\"><strong>book</strong> <strong>a</strong> <strong>single slot for each partner,&nbsp;</strong>but arrange them one after the other so both can attend at the same time.&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\"><em>(Rationale \u27a1 GP needs the details of <u>both</u> partners and a record that both attended. Arranging appts in tandem will mean that the doctor can talk to both together).</em></span></p><hr><p id=\"isPasted\"></p><p></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;\" id=\"isPasted\">If you suspect a safeguarding concern, book GP same-day F2F. If no capacity, speak with Duty Doctor on site.</span></p><div class=\"zt-accordion\"><details class=\"zt-ac-block\"><summary class=\"zt-ac-title\"><h3><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Duty Doctor template</span></strong></h3></summary><div class=\"zt-ac-body-container\"><div class=\"zt-ac-body\"><div id=\"isPasted\"><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Request</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;- one line stating what is requested of the Duty Doctor</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Symptom</strong> - issue / problem patient called for</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Zingtree information</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Current symptoms</u> - anything that was \"ticked\" on Zingtree, list these in bullet point</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Duration</u> - state how long patient has been experiencing symptoms (if relevant)</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Treatment trialled</u> - state any OTC or previous treatments the patient has tried (if relevant - from patient or recent EMIS consultation notes)</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Timeframe</u> of suggested outcome listed on ZT if DD not first option - same day, within 24 hours etc</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Clinicians</u> listed on ZT if DD not first option - state why these were not chosen</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>Example</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Management of high blood pressure with no symptoms</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patient blood pressure recorded at home 200/100</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patient does not have regular medication for their blood pressure</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Zingtree outcome suggests:</li></ul><ol><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GP same-day, F2F</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Duty doctor list</li></ol><ul><li data-list-indent=\"1\" data-list-type=\"bulleted\" style=\"margin-left: 32px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p>No GP same day appt, therefore added to DD list</p></li></ul></div></div></div></details></div><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
