 "wh_reassure_2": {
  "code": "1.info, Accurx | 2.contactservice | 3.discuss",
  "html": "<div data-v-5817b1e6=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(54, 54, 54); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(254, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\"><h3 data-v-5817b1e6=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 24px 0px 12px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(191, 67, 67); font-size: 28px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 24px;\">Reassure patient that these symptoms are common after abortion and will likely get better.</span></span></h3><h3 data-v-5817b1e6=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 24px 0px 12px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(191, 67, 67); font-size: 28px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 24px;\">If patient requires more support or reassurance, they can contact the abortion clinic to discuss their symptoms further.</span></span></h3><ul><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;\" id=\"isPasted\">They can also seek advice and support via an MSI <span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\">Reproductive Choices&nbsp;</span></span></span>clinic, if they prefer. &nbsp;S<span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\">end patient a link via Accurx to MSI website: <a href=\"https://www.msichoices.org.uk/abortion/abortion-aftercare/medical-abortion-recovery/\" target=\"_blank\">Medical Abortion (Abortion with pills) Recovery and Aftercare - MSI Reproductive Choices UK</a></span></span></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(226, 80, 65); font-size: 24px;\">If you suspect a safeguarding concern, book <strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">GP same-day F2F</strong>. If no capacity, add to Duty Doctor list.</span></p></div><div data-v-37e0392a=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(54, 54, 54); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(254, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div data-v-37e0392a=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px 15px; margin: 0px; position: relative; min-height: 1px; float: left; width: 1170px;\"><div data-v-2b27a37b=\"\" data-v-37e0392a=\"\" data-test-id=\"zt-content-canvas-136\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><div data-v-2b27a37b=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: -12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; flex: 1 1 auto;\"><div data-v-2b27a37b=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 12px; margin: 0px; width: 1164px; flex-basis: 0px; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%;\"><div data-v-2b27a37b=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-right: -12px; margin-bottom: -12px; margin-left: -12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; flex: 1 1 auto;\"><div data-v-2b27a37b=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding-top: 12px; padding-right: 0px !important; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 12px; margin: 0px; width: 1164px; flex-basis: 0px; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%;\"><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p><br></p><p id=\"isPasted\"></p><p></p><div class=\"zt-accordion\"><details class=\"zt-ac-block\"><summary class=\"zt-ac-title\"><h3><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Duty Doctor template</span></strong></h3></summary><div class=\"zt-ac-body-container\"><div class=\"zt-ac-body\"><div id=\"isPasted\"><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Request</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;- one line stating what is requested of the Duty Doctor</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Symptom</strong> - issue / problem patient called for</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Zingtree information</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Current symptoms</u> - anything that was \"ticked\" on Zingtree, list these in bullet point</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Duration</u> - state how long patient has been experiencing symptoms (if relevant)</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Treatment trialled</u> - state any OTC or previous treatments the patient has tried (if relevant - from patient or recent EMIS consultation notes)</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Timeframe</u> of suggested outcome listed on ZT if DD not first option - same day, within 24 hours etc</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Clinicians</u> listed on ZT if DD not first option - state why these were not chosen</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>Example</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Management of high blood pressure with no symptoms</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patient blood pressure recorded at home 200/100</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patient does not have regular medication for their blood pressure</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Zingtree outcome suggests:</li></ul><ol><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GP same-day, F2F</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Duty doctor list</li></ol><ul><li data-list-indent=\"1\" data-list-type=\"bulleted\" style=\"margin-left: 32px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p>No GP same day appt, therefore added to DD list</p></li></ul></div></div></div></details></div><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
  "src": "womens_health",
  "sug": "Women's Health &nbsp;suggested outcome: 1.&nbsp; Reassure patient. 2. Advise patient to contact Abortion Clinic 3. Discuss with Clinical Oversight",
  "title": "Outcome: Reassure"
 },
