ferrer\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"color: rgb(84, 172, 210); font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Check Sexual Health services on the services database here on Penrose Portal</span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;\" id=\"isPasted\">If you suspect a safeguarding concern, book GP same-day F2F. If no capacity, speak with Duty Doctor on site.</span></p><div class=\"zt-accordion\"><details class=\"zt-ac-block\"><summary class=\"zt-ac-title\"><h3><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Duty Doctor template</span></strong></h3></summary><div class=\"zt-ac-body-container\"><div class=\"zt-ac-body\"><div id=\"isPasted\"><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Request</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;- one line stating what is requested of the Duty Doctor</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Symptom</strong> - issue / problem patient called for</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Zingtree information</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Current symptoms</u> - anything that was \"ticked\" on Zingtree, list these in bullet point</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Duration</u> - state how long patient has been experiencing symptoms (if relevant)</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Treatment trialled</u> - state any OTC or previous treatments the patient has tried (if relevant - from patient or recent EMIS consultation notes)</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Timeframe</u> of suggested outcome listed on ZT if DD not first option - same day, within 24 hours etc</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Clinicians</u> listed on ZT if DD not first option - state why these were not chosen</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>Example</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Management of high blood pressure with no symptoms</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patient blood pressure recorded at home 200/100</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patient does not have regular medication for their blood pressure</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Zingtree outcome suggests:</li></ul><ol><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GP same-day, F2F</li><li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Duty doctor list</li></ol><ul><li data-list-indent=\"1\" data-list-type=\"bulleted\" style=\"margin-left: 32px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p>No GP same day appt, therefore added to DD list</p></li></ul></div></div></div></details></div><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
